# Sequence Diagram — Item Reserveren
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant Browser
    participant ItemController
    participant ReservationRepository
    participant ItemRepository
    participant Database

    Student->>Browser: Ga naar /itemlist
    Browser->>ItemController: GET /itemlist
    ItemController->>ItemRepository: findByFilter(campusId, category)
    ItemRepository->>Database: SELECT query
    Database-->>ItemRepository: List van items
    ItemRepository-->>ItemController: List van items
    ItemController-->>Browser: itemlist.html met items

    Student->>Browser: Klik op item
    Browser->>ItemController: GET /itemdetails/1
    ItemController->>ItemRepository: findById(1)
    ItemRepository->>Database: SELECT query
    Database-->>ItemRepository: Item object
    ItemRepository-->>ItemController: Item object
    ItemController->>ReservationRepository: findFirstByItemIdAndEndDateGreaterThanEqual(1, today)
    ReservationRepository->>Database: SELECT query
    Database-->>ReservationRepository: Reservatie object
    ReservationRepository-->>ItemController: Reservatie object
    ItemController-->>Browser: itemdetails.html met reservatie info

    Student->>Browser: Kies datums en reserveer
    Browser->>ItemController: POST /reserveer/1
    ItemController->>ReservationRepository: existsByItemIdAndDates(1, start, end)
    ReservationRepository->>Database: SELECT query
    Database-->>ReservationRepository: false
    ReservationRepository-->>ItemController: false
    ItemController->>ReservationRepository: save(reservatie)
    ReservationRepository->>Database: INSERT query
    Database-->>ReservationRepository: OK
    ItemController-->>Browser: Redirect naar bevestiging
```
